# Do not launch the game

Do not start Factorio unless the user explicitly asks to open, launch, or run the game.

This includes the client, a headless or server instance, and any command whose purpose is to start the game binary to check a mod.

Unit tests, packaging, and portal scripts are fine. They do not start the game.

```bash
# ❌ BAD
factorio --load-game test
~/.factorio/bin/x64/factorio

# ✅ GOOD
bash .github/scripts/run-tests.sh
```
